 ", is defined as follows:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"13539455-48ed-4e99-b09e-bf561d739d84"],

Cell["\<\
faa=-2203841 Cos[2 \[Theta]]/1920 + 5579141 Cos[4 \[Theta]]/153600 - 214597 \
Cos[6 \[Theta]]/103680 +
     48211 Cos[8 \[Theta]]/307200 - 251 Cos[10 \[Theta]]/19200 + 25 Cos[12 \
\[Theta]]/165888 - 
